                            <comment id="15465117" author="v.pyatkov" created="Mon, 5 Sep 2016 14:20:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I found incorrect behavior of the getAndPutIfAbsent  method of cache in transaction. By that reason the task has not be fixed yet.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sboikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sboikov&quot;&gt;sboikov&lt;/a&gt; could you please look it?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15503758" author="sboikov" created="Mon, 19 Sep 2016 15:24:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In tx cache putIfAbsent does not properly handle case when old value is loaded from remote node, implemented fix, need verify TC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
